<v Rahul>Design is done, but the payment testing needs one more week.</v>

3
00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:16.000
<v Priya>Then let's move the launch from 8 October to 15 October. Everyone okay with that?</v>

4
00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:18.000
<v Rahul>Yes, agreed.</v>

5
00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:20.000
<v Meera>Agreed.</v>

6
00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:25.000
<v Priya>I'll update the launch deck with the new date by Friday.</v>

7
00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:30.000
<v Rahul>I'll finish payment testing by the 13th.</v>

8
00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:35.000
<v Meera>Someone should also tell the support team about the new date.</v>
